Package: measError
Type: Package
Title: Simple Measurement Error Regression Simulation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Xiuping", "Chen", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "xiuping@example.invalid")
Description: Simulates two independent noisy measurements of a latent covariate
    and estimates the slope by ordinary least squares or instrumental variables.
